  "title": "QUIC: fix heuristic",
  "description": "In the heuristic function we don't know the length of the CID in the short header, so we assume the worst case scenario compatible with packet length (no more than 20 bytes)\n\n\nYou can reproduce the issue with [quic_heur.pcapng](/uploads/3ca3607fa5c466b37cdc4132b348292f/quic_heur.pcapng) and disabling STUN protocol: packet 20 throws a Malformed Exception",
