  "discussions_data": [
    {
      "id": "83a25d9d51976bfd69309ba8a7bee59c0a70b0b5",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 429089552,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "So isn't there a risk now to ignore a valid packet that would use a shorter CID and be small enough not to have those extra 19 bytes? (disclaimer: I do not know QUIC protocol).",
          "author": {
            "id": 6722527,
            "username": "pquantin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Pascal Quantin",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9bf49edc6acae0eca821eb90309381794fb4fbea4f3fb7c2378428862ddbb430?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/pquantin"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-10-13T18:52:44.295Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-10-13T19:02:49.757Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 74282300,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2020-10-14T20:06:42.972Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 571,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 429093541,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "You concern seems valid. In this heuristic function, AFAIU we always search for the longest CID and if the lookup fails, we return FALSE: I don't know how the heuristic can possible return TRUE for real QUIC packets with (a valid) shorter CID... (regardless of my change)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6875072,
            "username": "IvanNardi",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Ivan Nardi",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d4707801b74ca8478d56b09acecfa8671e536be3815713358ed72bab52474738?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/IvanNardi"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-10-13T19:02:49.710Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-10-13T19:02:49.710Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 74282300,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2020-10-14T20:06:42.972Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 571,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 429824346,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The packet at minimum includes 1 (flag byte), 1 (minimum packet number length), and 16 (authentication tag for the encrypted payload), resulting in 18 bytes. On top of that, the DCID can be added.\n\nDCID can be empty, but in that case our heuristics will not be able to find an existing connection based on the connection tuple anyway which is why we require at minimum 1 byte for the connection lookup by DCID.\n\nNormally the heuristics dissector is not invoked, only when the IP/port tuple is seen for the first time with no QUIC on it. Once QUIC is identified, the heuristics dissector is skipped.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-10-14T20:06:42.509Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-10-14T20:06:42.509Z",
